OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners say river bacteria
OL,4,Alevels too high
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Yorkshire Water said
OL,7,Fit understood public concern over river
OL,8,Fpollution, including in the Ouse, and
OL,9,Fwas "committed to improving it".
